MerkleAdapter Liquid Lane signatures
├── single-output approval
│   ├── matches the pinned Reactor digest for arbitrary amounts, nonce and recipient
│   ├── pins domain, type hashes, pair, recipient, protocol, hash program and ABI layout
│   ├── rejects a changed hash program or output layout through the leaf
│   └── cannot authorize altered fields, chains or Reactors
└── pinned Reactor settlement
    ├── fills an approved request with an empty ERC1271 signature
    ├── pays the recipient fixed in the approved leaf
    ├── rejects unapproved and revoked requests
    ├── enforces expiration independently of the approval flag
    └── rejects reused and cancelled nonces
